stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> CloseoutVerified
    CloseoutVerified --> InventoryChecking
    InventoryChecking --> BlockedIdentity: identity or digest drift
    InventoryChecking --> BlockedInventory: archive incomplete
    InventoryChecking --> EvidenceChecking: inventory verified
    EvidenceChecking --> BlockedEvidence: missing / unreadable / invalid storage
    EvidenceChecking --> RetentionChecking: all required evidence readable
    RetentionChecking --> BlockedRetention: expired or too short
    RetentionChecking --> RetentionReady: window and policy pass
    RetentionReady --> HumanPolicyDecision
    HumanPolicyDecision --> [*]
